  "description": "The bench layout of Synth, the synthetic waveform of the common tests: a pin_clk with two rising edges per T-state, f2 high at the second, the pins and the registers directly under i8080_tb, sampled after the edge. It has the exchange register, so the DE/HL swap is covered; it is not any RTL's manifest.",
